---
title: ytif · gate execution
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    mainBkg: "#333333"
    clusterBkg: "#242424"
  themeCSS: |
    small { display: inline-block; text-align: left; }
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 300
---
%% Behavior authority: README.md (Gates, The inventory, gate-config paragraphs) and internal/gate (gate.go Run, survey.go NewSurvey, collect.go, present.go), internal/reconcile, internal/gateconf, internal/proc, internal/affected.
%% ytif list runs the same survey (list.go) and stops there.
%% --jobs N bounds the processes ytif starts through proc.Run across preparation, discovery, narrowing and dispatch (gate.go:72); workers inside a started tool are the project's configuration. Preparation and narrowing run alone, before and after discovery.
%% Findings do not short-circuit dispatch; a selected check whose run would also run an unselected check is held back without an outcome. The verdict fails on any finding, failed check, check without an outcome, invocation error, or run problem (present.go:107-109).
%% Early errors (unknown gate, unresolved --base, unreadable inventory or exemptions, unreadable file scope) exit 2 without records; a records write failure also exits 2.
%% Narrowing drops only test-runner checks whose unit lies in an Nx project the changes since the merge base do not affect; verify checks and units outside every project stay. Without nx.json or a graph, nothing is narrowed.
flowchart TB
  Base["Resolve --base<br/><small>• when ci --base is set<br/>• merge-base<br/>• exit 2 on failure</small>"]
  subgraph Survey["Survey · ytif list stops here"]
    Prepare["inventory prepare<br/><small>• sequentially from repository root<br/>• a failed command fails its runners' discovery</small>"]
    Discover["Discovery<br/><small>• all runners concurrently<br/>• independent of gate selection<br/>• Git-tracked files only</small>"]
    Reconcile["Reconcile checks<br/><small>• managed: discovered, inventoried, valid placement<br/>• mismatches become findings</small>"]
    GateConf["gate-config<br/><small>• lefthook and workflow steps<br/>• ytif call or matching exemption<br/>• direct test runs cannot be exempted<br/>• unclassified commands become findings</small>"]
    Prepare --> Discover --> Reconcile --> GateConf
  end
  Select["Cumulative placement selection<br/><small>• managed checks only<br/>• commit ⊂ push ⊂ ci</small>"]
  Narrow["Narrow with --base<br/><small>• when ci --base is set<br/>• test runners only<br/>• Nx affected<br/>• no graph means no narrowing</small>"]
  Dispatch["Dispatch<br/><small>• runners execute concurrently<br/>• results printed in runner order</small>"]
  Verdict["Verdict<br/><small>any finding, failure, missing outcome or error fails the gate</small>"]
  Records["Append records<br/><small>exit 2 on write failure</small>"]
  Jobs["--jobs N<br/><small>• concurrent processes started through proc.Run<br/>• shared across prepare, discovery, narrowing and dispatch<br/>• excludes git, go env, go mod edit and tool-internal workers</small>"]
  subgraph Scope["File scope · verify input, not a test filter"]
    C["ytif commit<br/><small>staged files</small>"]
    P["ytif push<br/><small>files changed by pushed refs</small>"]
    I["ytif ci<br/><small>all tracked files</small>"]
  end
  Base --> Prepare
  GateConf --> Select --> Narrow --> Dispatch --> Verdict --> Records
  Reconcile -.->|finding| Verdict
  GateConf -.->|finding| Verdict
  Jobs -.- Survey
  Jobs -.- Narrow
  Jobs -.- Dispatch
  Dispatch -.- Scope
  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Verdict em
